SUMMARY:Cornhole League
DESCRIPTION:Looking for a fun way to spend your Tuesday evenings? \nThe Highland Brewing Cornhole League is all about good beer\, great vibes\, and making new friends! Whether you’re a seasoned pro or just tossing for fun\, everyone’s welcome to join. \nWinter leagues are indoors\, while May through October brings friendly competition out to the Meadow (weather permitting).\nSave your spot\, grab a pint\, and get ready for some laughs and laid-back fun with the Highland Brewing community! \nCheck for registering leagues here.
