SUMMARY:Problem Child
DESCRIPTION:Bio\nPROBLEM/CHILD Tribute to AC/DC who hails from North Carolina is a HIGH ENERGY ROCK AND ROLL BAND\, Who Can give your establishment a full night of great music. We are so much more than expected because we also do a variety of great classic rock.  If you want a band that really delivers the live AC/DC Sound\,You don’t need to look any further! PROBLEM/CHILD began in 2006 and has played many Bike Rallies-Headlining Major Rallies Such As…The Angel City Bike Rally In Unadilla\,Ga\, The Boone Bike Rally In Boone\, NC And The 2 Rivers Bike Rally In Eden\,NC!!!\,Also Playing Many Bars\,Special Events and Private Parties! When you book a PROBLEM/CHILD Show\, You can expect a Professional\,High Energy\,Rock And Roll Extravaganza! \nWeekend Live Music\nHighland Brewing’s weekend live music series showcases incredible local talent\, regional acts and national touring bands from across the East Coast and beyond. Free and open to all ages (unless noted otherwise)\, it’s the perfect excuse to gather your crew\, listen and vibe to a wide range of genres including soul\, bluegrass\, acoustic\, country\, folk and more.\nLive music typically takes place on our scenic Meadow stage. Shows are rain or shine\, if the weather doesn’t cooperate and we have time to move inside\, the band will play in the Taproom where there’s still plenty of room to boogie.\nChairs\, blankets and well-behaved\, leashed pets are welcome in the Meadow. Please note that coolers and outside alcohol are not permitted on the premises. \n 
URL:https://highlandbrewing.com/calendar/problem-child/
