SUMMARY:Thunderstruck Tour with Beer & Coffee Tasting
DESCRIPTION:Get an inside look at Asheville’s first brewery on this 90-minute guided experience\, featuring an exclusive look at the return of our fall seasonal\, Thunderstruck Coffee Porter. \nBOOK THE TOUR \nThis tour takes you through Highland’s brewhouse\, Taproom and outdoor spaces\, led by a Highland Brewing Ambassador who offers a behind-the-scenes look at our brewing process\, history and what makes Highland what it is today. Along the way\, you’ll enjoy a tasting of 5 Highland beers from our year-round and seasonal line-up\, including a sample of Thunderstruck. \nThunderstruck is brewed in collaboration with Dynamite Roasting Co.\, who will join the tour to lead a tasting of the coffee blend used in the beer. \nSnag a bag of the limited edition Thunderstruck Coffee (Medium Roast) during check out to experience the brew at home! \nPlease note: \n\nParticipants must be +21. A valid ID will be required at check-in.\nCLOSED-TOED SHOES ARE REQUIRED.\nWeather permitting\, this tour includes indoor and outdoor elements.\nAnimals\, including service animals\, are not allowed on tours.\nTips are always appreciated!\n\nTours will meet in the retail space in Highland Brewing’s Taproom \nBOOK THE TOUR \nQuestions? Please contact tours@highlandbrewing.com
URL:https://highlandbrewing.com/calendar/brewery-tour-beer-coffee-tasting-with-dynamite-coffee/
LOCATION:Taproom At Highland Brewing Co.\, 12 Old Charlotte Highway\, Suite 200\, Asheville\, NC\, 28803\, United States
CATEGORIES:Public Events
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://highlandbrewing.com/wp-content/uploads/Screenshot-2026-09-17-at-4.02.14-PM.png
END:VEVENT
