UID:10029867-1791122400-1791133200@highlandbrewing.com
SUMMARY:Thunderstruck Release Party
DESCRIPTION:Thunderstruck Release Party | Sunday\, October 4 \nYou’ve been Thunderstruck and it’s coming your way — join us for beer\, coffee and rock ‘n’ roll as we celebrate the return of Thunderstruck Coffee Porter! \nLive Music: 2-5pm\nProblem Child\, a Tribute to AC/DC\, is bringing the thunder (and the lightning) from 2-5pm. It’s a long way to the top\, but we’ll get there together. Check them out here. \nThunderstruck Coffee Sampling\nWe’ve teamed up with Dynamite Roasting Co. for a coffee sampling that’ll have you saying “for those about to sip\, we salute you.” \nOn Tap & To Go\nThunderstruck will be flowing all day\, on tap and ready to take home for those who like it loud (or just like it in a can). \nBrewery Tour\, Beer & Coffee Tasting BOOK\nGo behind the scenes on a special Thunderstruck Brewery Tour with a guided beer and coffee tasting — no highway to hell required\, just a quick walk through the brewhouse. Learn more and book here. \nRock or bust — see you October 4th!
URL:https://highlandbrewing.com/calendar/thunderstruck-release-party/
LOCATION:Meadow at Highland Brewing Co.\, 12 Old Charlotte Highway\, Suite 200\, Asheville\, NC\, 28803\, United States
CATEGORIES:Live Music,Public Events
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://highlandbrewing.com/wp-content/uploads/Problem-Child-1.png
END:VEVENT
END:VCALENDAR